1
00:00:02,435 --> 00:00:04,265
(Leonard:)Have you guys heard
about this research team

2
00:00:04,271 --> 00:00:07,471
(Leonard:)that's trying to transgenically
manipulate chicken DNA

3
00:00:07,475 --> 00:00:09,845
(Leonard:)to create some sort
of chicken dinosaur?

4
00:00:09,844 --> 00:00:12,674
(Sheldon:)Oh, I think that
sounds wonderful.

5
00:00:14,181 --> 00:00:17,781
(Howard:)What? You're afraid
of both dinosaurs and chickens.

6
00:00:17,785 --> 00:00:18,885
(Sheldon:)Yes, but tell me

7
00:00:18,886 --> 00:00:20,986
(Sheldon:)a dinosaur
chicken salad sandwich

8
00:00:20,988 --> 00:00:22,588
(Sheldon:)wouldn't hit the Mesozoic spot.

9
00:00:26,227 --> 00:00:27,497
(Raj:)Hey, guys.
Hey.
Hello.

10
00:00:27,495 --> 00:00:28,965
(Raj:)We still on for
tomorrow night?

11
00:00:28,963 --> 00:00:31,093
(Leonard:)Yeah. I'm excited
to finally meet your girlfriend.

12
00:00:31,098 --> 00:00:33,228
Yeah, oh, and
speaking of which.

13
00:00:33,234 --> 00:00:35,904
(Sheldon:)According to a recent study
out of Oxford University,

14
00:00:35,903 --> 00:00:37,233
(Sheldon:)when someone takes on

15
00:00:37,238 --> 00:00:39,108
(Sheldon:)a new romantic
partner,

16
00:00:39,106 --> 00:00:41,936
(Sheldon:)that person loses one
or two close friends.

17
00:00:41,942 --> 00:00:44,742
(Howard:)Since when do you read
social science?

18
00:00:44,745 --> 00:00:47,615
(Sheldon:)I go to the bathroom
like everybody else.

19
00:00:47,615 --> 00:00:49,085
(Raj:)Why would I lose friends

20
00:00:49,083 --> 00:00:50,913
(Raj:)just because I
started dating someone?

21
00:00:50,918 --> 00:00:53,048
(Leonard:)Yeah, you didn't lose anyone
when you met Amy.

22
00:00:53,054 --> 00:00:56,224
Yeah, well, no, the study
refers to romantic partners.

23
00:00:56,223 --> 00:00:59,393
(Leonard:)Not the way I would
categorize the two of us.

24
00:00:59,393 --> 00:01:01,123
(Raj:)You guys kiss and hold hands.

25
00:01:01,128 --> 00:01:03,498
(Leonard:)I've seen him do it.
It's not romantic.

26
00:01:03,497 --> 00:01:05,727
(Raj:)Look, I'm not the kind of guy

27
00:01:05,733 --> 00:01:08,533
(Raj:)who drops his friends just
because he's in a relationship.

28
00:01:08,536 --> 00:01:10,206
(Leonard:)What happens
if she doesn't like us?

29
00:01:10,204 --> 00:01:11,604
(Raj:)Well, hey,
you're my dear friends.

30
00:01:11,605 --> 00:01:13,905
(Raj:)You'll get a Christmas card
for a couple of years,

31
00:01:13,908 --> 00:01:18,038
(Raj:)and then you're dead to me.

